& [ChallengeCase]
  + operation descriptions could be misread as shell commands or execution grants
  + a host-success claim could be overstated as actual build or autonomous-agent performance

& [Resolution]
  + closed atom arrays grants0 denials15 unresolved5 planned_effectless disposition and explicit non-equivalence clauses remove those promotions
  + physical build source transfer and toolchain capability remain outside and require new source governance

& [Readiness]
  + ready for satisfaction signature and independent formation verification
  + not ready for implementation until formation publication bookend and not ready for remote effects until implementation publication bookend
